=== layout: two-panels

# Restriction Enzyme\: EcoRI

@left

- `G|AATTC`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`G|AATTC`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA|G`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?

@right

- EcoRI

=== layout: two-panels

# Restriction Enzyme\: EcoRI

@left

- `G|AATTC`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`G|AATTC`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA|G`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?
  - 5&prime;-G
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA`-5&prime;
- What is the overhang?

@right

- EcoRI

=== layout: two-panels

# Restriction Enzyme\: EcoRI

@left

- `G|AATTC`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`G|AATTC`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA|G`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?
  - 5&prime;-G-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA`-5&prime;
- What is the overhang?
  - 5&prime; overhang (the 5&prime; is all alone at the end)
  - 3&prime;-`TTAA`-5&prime; or 5&prime;-`AATT`-3&prime;

@right

- EcoRI

